## ANTI-SLOP RULES (non-negotiable)

| ❌ FORBIDDEN | ✅ REQUIRED |
|--------------|-------------|
| Fake terminal chrome ($ prompts, green-tinted blocks) | Clean structured cards, subtle meta headers |
| Box shadows | 1px borders + glass tiers only |
| Emoji empty states | Engagement templates, recent items, "New Engagement" flow |
| Linear easing | Spring curves ONLY (`--spring-*`) |
| Chat bubbles for tool output | Structured blocks (plan/tool/diff/finding/artifact) |
| 44px touch targets | 28px rows, density like Linear/Cursor |
| Generic "Message AI..." hero | Terminal-first: left=targets, center=agent, right=findings, bottom=AI strip |

---

## THINKING LOGO SYSTEM

The NIL blocky N monogram = agent state indicator (4 states):

| State | Visual |
|-------|--------|
| **Idle** | Static N, violet on abyss |
| **Thinking** | N notches breathe + 2-3 ThinkingOrbs orbit (coral + lavender) |
| **Streaming** | Orbs converge into N, glow + BorderBeam sweeps edge |
| **Done** | N snaps to cream, soft pulse |

Component: `ThinkingLogo.svelte` — wraps `ThinkingOrbs.svelte` + N monogram SVG
Location: top-right titlebar / sidebar header / AI strip
`prefers-reduced-motion` = static N only

