## COMPONENT PRIMITIVES (bits-ui + our tokens)

- Buttons: Primary/Secondary/Ghost/Danger — glass tiers, spring press
- Inputs: glass-2, focus = BorderBeam
- Cards: glass-1/2, edge refraction highlight
- Command Palette: cmdk-svelte, Raycast-level
- Toasts: svelte-sonner + cuelume sounds + glass tiers
- Icons: lucide-svelte + morphicons (transitions) + reicon (2700+)

---

## SOUNDS (cuelume — 2KB, zero config)

```html
<button data-cuelume="click">...</button>
<button data-cuelume="success">...</button>
<button data-cuelume="error">...</button>
<!-- click, success, error, notification, complete, deny, select, hover, scroll, back -->
```

---

## MOTION (svelte-motion)

- Layout animations: `spring-bouncy` for playful, `spring-smooth` for UI, `spring-window` for panels
- Shared layout transitions via `SpringTransition` component
- `prefers-reduced-motion` disables all motion instantly

---

## ACCESSIBILITY (mandatory)

- Focus visible always (BorderBeam on focus)
- Keyboard-first: every action reachable via Cmd+K palette
- `@zag-js/svelte` for complex primitives (select, date-picker, slider, tabs)
- Rogue focus trapping in sheets/modals